content.text:
The v2 work-orders endpoint has a body-parsing issue where it consistently finds `inspection_id` "missing" despite it being in the body — this appears to be a server-side issue. The v1 endpoint successfully opened a work order linked to inspection `insp-7c2e-2203`. Here is the result:

```json
{
  "work_order_id": "wo-legacy-0001"
}
```
